WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:02.993
Your Lead Conversion Clarity Call
is booked.

2
00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.400
You probably booked this

3
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.020
because your ads bring in leads,

4
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:08.290
but very few of them

5
00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:09.719
convert into site visits.

6
00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.395
Maybe replies go out late,

7
00:00:11.435 --> 00:00:12.660
or maybe follow-ups stop

8
00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.131
after a day or two.

9
00:00:14.171 --> 00:00:15.690
Maybe buyers don’t turn up

10
00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:16.947
for booked visits.

11
00:00:16.987 --> 00:00:19.300
Or you just know that your paid leads

12
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.983
are getting cold somewhere,

13
00:00:21.023 --> 00:00:22.369
but you don’t know exactly where.

14
00:00:22.409 --> 00:00:24.175
On this call, we will do three things.

15
00:00:24.215 --> 00:00:26.141
First, we will map out the lead journey.

16
00:00:26.181 --> 00:00:27.847
How leads come in today,

17
00:00:27.887 --> 00:00:30.839
and what happens between
the lead coming in

18
00:00:30.879 --> 00:00:32.035
and the site visit.

19
00:00:32.075 --> 00:00:35.061
Second, we’ll find out
where leads go cold.

20
00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.037
Third, we’ll build a plan for it,

21
00:00:37.077 --> 00:00:38.550
so more of the leads

22
00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:40.310
which you have already paid for

23
00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.843
convert into site visits.

24
00:00:41.883 --> 00:00:43.520
To get the most out of this call,

25
00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.909
get these three numbers ready.

26
00:00:44.949 --> 00:00:47.115
First is, what was
your last month ad spend?

27
00:00:47.155 --> 00:00:48.801
Second is, how many leads did you get?

28
00:00:48.841 --> 00:00:50.803
And third is, how many of those leads

29
00:00:50.843 --> 00:00:52.279
converted into site visits?

30
00:00:52.319 --> 00:00:53.665
Rough numbers are also fine.

31
00:00:53.705 --> 00:00:55.460
The invite with the Google Meet link

32
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.731
has already been shared on your email.

33
00:00:57.771 --> 00:01:00.547
And join in from your laptop,
so that you can clearly see my screen.

34
00:01:00.587 --> 00:01:01.903
And if you haven’t yet,

35
00:01:01.943 --> 00:01:03.960
tap Confirm on WhatsApp button

36
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.470
right above this video,

37
00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:06.539
and send the message,

38
00:01:06.579 --> 00:01:08.075
so that I know that you are coming.

39
00:01:08.115 --> 00:01:10.390
I’ll also show how
the Warm-Chain System works,

40
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:12.281
and we’ll check if your project qualifies.

41
00:01:12.321 --> 00:01:14.430
If it does, we’ll also talk about

42
00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:16.510
how my team is going to install

43
00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:17.657
and manage it for you.

44
00:01:17.697 --> 00:01:20.280
Worst case scenario,
you will walk away knowing

45
00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:21.880
where your leads are going cold,

46
00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.043
and how do you fix it.

47
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.390
Further down this page,
you will basically see that

48
00:01:25.430 --> 00:01:28.389
what all you’re getting
as part of this Warm-Chain System.

49
00:01:28.429 --> 00:01:30.925
Have a look at it,
and do bring your questions to the call.

50
00:01:30.965 --> 00:01:32.580
See you on the call.
